# Making Headlines (windurst 37): the scoop NPCs once the quest is completed, where their arms (accepted only) give way
# to their scripts. Accepted with the four scoops and the door by GM (the var 31), completed at Naiko-Paneiko (674 or
# 670, the roll: 674 here; Editor's Hatchet Man, 560 gil, the var cleared). Then Kyume-Romeh: his 604 or 393 (the
# roll: 393 here); Yujuju: his 340; Hiwon-Biwon: his random default (305 / 306 / 168 / 170 / 169: 168 here).
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-245.4,-5.3,-308.0 job=WAR lvl=75
login
quest Windurst.MakingHeadlines accepted
charvar QuestMakingHeadlines_var 31
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                   # the four scoops and the door: 674 or 670 (the roll)
finish                                  # completed; Editor's Hatchet Man; 560 gil; the var cleared
warp -56.0,-4.5,23.2 WindurstWaters
trigger Kyume-Romeh                     # completed: his 604 or 393 (the roll)
finish
warp 200.0,-4.8,139.0 PortWindurst
trigger Yujuju                          # completed: his 340
finish
warp 114.0,-2.4,99.0 WindurstWalls
trigger Hiwon-Biwon                     # completed: his random default
finish
